output={'source_commit':source,'scope':'Genuine SDK source/error/caller bindings, header-derived protocol enums and deferred promises glob policy','oracle':'Node v26.12.0 latest stable, official index rechecked 2026-10-16T10:33Z','checks':{'core':660,'api':378,'framework':43,'shared':7,'workspace_all_targets':True,'focused_native_oracles':4,'framework_scenarios':3,'empty_differentials':5},'tracked_source_files':len(manifest),'family':{k:family[k]for k in ['before','candidate','total','gained','lost','skip_changes']},'fixed_work':{'valid':8,'clean':sum(bool(r['clean_rounds'])for r in fixed['fixtures'].values()),'speed_claim':False},'design':['Core captured error metadata shares immutable compiler text, owns no guest objects and survives collection or duplicate filenames. Current activation fallback never invokes guest stack/proxy/name hooks.','Source positions derive from actual captured records; Node projects null-prototype metadata, zero-based start columns and undefined unnamed-eval resources.','Unchanged configured Acorn is embedded through the existing shared dependency table for original Node assertion expression extraction.','Exit-code and compile-cache protocol tables derive from configured SDK macro owners, retaining original descriptors, ordering and binding identity. This does not implement compile-cache operations.','Caller location projects genuine VM activations and compilation origin, without fabricated bootstrap frames or stack hooks.','Promises glob materializes the actual unchanged SDK export as a lazy data property, preserving descriptors and OS binding-capture order without eagerly importing readline/history.'],'limitations':['All-parallel goal remains open; latest frozen e9 stable full is1791/5015 and pinned full is1821/4727, both from immutable e9. No selected-case sums substituted.','No speed claim; concurrent compilation/audits and actual instruction/RSS screen diagnostics retained.','Initial all-API run377pass/1fail: the unchanged500ms child-liveness probe did not receive a PID under the concurrent pinned full audit. Isolated unchanged control passed2.10s; a full unchanged-source rerun after audits is retained separately. No deadline or assertion changed.','Initial source binding check had incorrect descriptor-helper calls, retained and corrected. First focused attempt exposed missing Acorn dependency; the assertion comparison was preserved and dependency owner fixed.','Initial Core attempt659pass/1fail used embedding eval in a new test while expecting Script origin. Corrected test uses the explicit Script API and adds separate eval-origin assertions; original failed result retained.','Original node:test harness now progresses through genuine protocol/caller bindings to the missing native ContextifyScript; no fake VM class, callback, handle or compile-cache operation was introduced.','Regular-file stdin on stock Node loads OS before input execution, unlike -e or piped stdin; oracle mode controls are retained. All four qualified API comparisons use the same -e mode as the established runner.'],'raw':[raw(p)for p in paths if p.exists()]}
